{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0101030 - tRNA-guanine transglycosylation\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/27782#issuecomment-2713789035\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vJBNYzZh__OyjloGe1dJd7kvokwTsWiEeD0g1_rzdgo/edit?usp=sharing\n\nImpacted groups: \n\nComplexPortal 3\n~PomBase 3~ migrated to queuosine metabolism, pending removal of taxon constraint GO:1990397 queuosine salvage\n~UniProt 9~\ndictyBase 1\n\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \n\nGO:0101030 | unirule2go | UniRule:UR000106225 > GO:tRNA-guanine transglycosylation ; GO:0101030\nGO:0101030 | unirule2go | UniRule:UR000370983 > GO:tRNA-guanine transglycosylation ; GO:0101030\nGO:0101030 | unirule2go | UniRule:UR000592763 > GO:tRNA-guanine transglycosylation ; GO:0101030\nGO:0101030 | hamap2go | HAMAP:MF_03043 > GO:tRNA-guanine transglycosylation ; GO:0101030\nGO:0101030 | hamap2go | HAMAP:MF_03218 > GO:tRNA-guanine transglycosylation ; GO:0101030\nGO:0101030 | interpro2go | InterPro:IPR004803 tRNA-guanine transglycosylase > GO:tRNA-guanine transglycosylation ; GO:0101030\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-03-11T16:48:22Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to  GO:0101030- tRNA-guanine transglycosylation", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-03-31T12:27:59Z"}
